# Sentidol
sentidol-effect-melancholy = You feel a melancholic calm settling around you.
sentidol-effect-relaxation = You feel your body relaxing on waves of peace.
sentidol-effect-sleepy = Your body is exhausted, you feel sleep enveloping you.
sentidol-effect-overdose = Your muscles spasm, an uncontrollable smile appears on your face.

# Gliomorphin
gliomorphin-effect-haze = You feel your mind sinking into a faint haze of your own thoughts.
gliomorphin-effect-numb = Your mind is stuck in chilly sand. Your consciousness numbs...
gliomorphin-effect-pain = You feel a ringing pain in your temples. It builds up. It's unpleasant.
gliomorphin-effect-rage = You are overcome with blind rage. You want to throw everything, smash and break. No one can stop you!

# Illumidol
illumidol-effect-dizzy = Your mind dims. You feel slight dizziness, trying to make out the images flashing before you.
illumidol-effect-shake = Your body shakes, your pupils dilate wildly, the picture flickers before you.

# Synaptodol
synaptodol-effect-headache = You feel a minor headache.

